      "en": "The LORD spoke to Joshua, saying,",
      "ko": "여호와께서 여호수아에게 일러 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "0f522429c2698d92d41ebd42d9096b9098e7e3f3442ff4e4684d05c5dc7bb63e",
