      "en": "Joshua set up those twelve stones, which they took out of the Jordan, in Gilgal.",
      "ko": "여호수아가 그 요단에서 가져 온 열 두 돌을 길갈에 세우고",
      "source_text_hash": "da532156dfbd78e584a036847dd55334ade665d737c5b698d545a575f1427c99",
      "translation_text_hash": "b8944b96fe01fb2a569991e5460b2cd5f28c25b954eda521f9a6e5ceaf133733",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호수아가 그 요단에서 가져 온 열 두 돌을 길갈에 세우고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b8944b96fe01fb2a569991e5460b2cd5f28c25b954eda521f9a6e5ceaf133733"
      ]
